<title>BRAZIL: TENNIS-U.S. BEAT BRAZIL 4-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-U.S. BEAT BRAZIL 4-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>RIBEIRAO PRETO, Brazil 1997-02-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United States</p>
<p>beat Brazil 4-1 in their Davis Cup world group first round tie</p>
<p>on Sunday when they won both reverse singles.</p>
<p>Result (U.S. name first):</p>
<p>Jim Courier beat Gustavo Kuerten 6-3 6-2 5-7 7-6 (13-11)</p>
<p>Alex O'Brien beat Fernando Meligeni 7-5 7-6 (7-4)</p>
</text>
